#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kgeography; is a geography learning tool for &kde;. Right now it has seven "
"usage modes:"
msgstr ""
"&kgeography; je alat za učenje geografije za &kde; Trenutno ima sedam načina "
"korištenja:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Browse the maps clicking in a map division to see its name, capital and flag"
msgstr ""
"Pregledajte mape klikom na mapu podjele da vidite njeno ime, glavni grad i "
"zastavu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid "The game tells you a map division name and you have to click on it"
msgstr "Igra vam govori ime mape divizije i morate kliknuti na nju"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The game tells you a capital and you have to guess the division it belongs to"
msgstr "Igra vam govori glavni grad i vi morate pogoditi kojoj podjeli pripada"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid "The game tells you a division and you have to guess its capital"
msgstr "Igra vam govori podjele i morate pogoditi glavni grad"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "The game shows you a map division flag and you have to guess its name"
msgstr "Igra vam pokazuje zastave karte podjele , a vi morate pogoditi  ime"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "The game tells you a map division name and you have to guess its flag"
msgstr ""
"Igra vam govori ime područja sa karte, a vi morate pogoditi njegovu zastavu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The game shows an empty map and you have to place divisions on it one by one"
msgstr ""
"Igra pokazuje praznu kartu, a vi morate da smjestiti divizije na nju, jednu "
"po jednu"

