#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kgeography; is a geography learning tool for &kde;. It allows you to learn "
"about the political divisions of some countries (divisions, capitals of "
"those divisions and their associated flags if there are some)."
msgstr ""
"&kgeography; je alat za učenje geografije za &kde;. Omogućava vam da naučite "
"o političkim pokrajinama nekih država (pokrajinama, glavnim gradovima tih "
"pokrajina i njihovim zastava ako postoje)."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quick Start to &kgeography;"
msgstr "Brzo pokretanje &kgeography;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you run &kgeography; for the first time, it first asks you to choose a "
"map to start with."
msgstr ""
"Kada pokrenete &kgeography; po prvi put, prvo vas pita da odaberete mapu za "
"početak."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can filter the map list using <guilabel>Filter Maps</guilabel> text "
"field. Just enter a few first letters of the map name to narrow down the "
"list to a few matches."
msgstr ""
"Možete filtrirati kartu koristeći <guilabel>Filtriraj karte</guilabel> "
"tekstualno polje. Samo upišite prvih nekoliko slova imena karte da biste "
"suzili listu na par podudaranja."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<screeninfo>Here's a screenshot of &kgeography; at first start</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""
"<screeninfo>Ovdje je snimak zaslona &kgeography; pri prvom pokretanju</"
"screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Here's a screenshot of &kgeography; at first start</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase>Ovo je snimak zaslona od &kgeography; pri prvom pokretanju</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here we choose Canada"
msgstr "Ovdje biramo Kanadu"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Canada is chosen</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Kanada je odabrana</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:132
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Canada is chosen</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Kanada je odabrana</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid "And &kgeography; main window appears with the map of Canada:"
msgstr "I &kgeography; glavni prozor se prikazuje sa kartom Kanade:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kgeography; main window</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&kgeography; glavi prozor</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kgeography; main window</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&kgeography; glavni prozor</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can then choose what type of learning or testing you want to do by "
"looking at the menu on the left:"
msgstr ""
"Potom možete odabrati kakvu vrstu učenja ili testiranja želite raditi, "
"gledanjem na izbornik s lijeve strane:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:154
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kgeography; menu</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&kgeography; izbornik</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kgeography; menu</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&kgeography; izbornik</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Explore Map: a &LMB; click on an area of the map will display information "
"about that area, if you click on the small info icon on the popmap, it will "
"open the wikipedia page for that division in the system's default browser:"
msgstr ""
"Istražite kartu: &LMB; klikom na dio karte će se prikazati informacija o tom "
"dijelu, ako kliknete na malu ikonu na karti, otvorit će se slika sa "
"wikipedie za tu diviziju u zadanom sistemu:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Browse the map</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Pretraži mapu</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Browse the map</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Pretraži mapu</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Location of Provinces or Territories: you are first asked how many questions "
"you want"
msgstr ""
"Lokacija pokrajina ili teritorija: prvo ste upitani koliko pitanja želite"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>How many questions</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Koliko pitanja</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>How many questions</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Koliko pitanja</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid "Then you are asked to click on a specific province:"
msgstr "Potom se od vas traži da kliknete na određenu pokrajinu:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Click on a province</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Kliknite na pokrajinu</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Click on a province</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Kliknite na pokrajinu</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you finish all the questions, a result dialog is shown with your "
"correct and uncorrect answers:"
msgstr ""
"Kad odgovorite na sva pitanja, bit će prikazani rezultati sa vašim tačnim i "
"netačnim odgovorima:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:210 index.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Your results</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Vasi rezultati</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:216 index.docbook:258
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Your results</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Vasi rezultati</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Place Provinces or Territories in the Map: the cursor takes the shape of a "
"province and you have to place it in the map:"
msgstr ""
"Smjestite provincije ili teritorije u kartu: kursor uzima oblika provincije "
"i vi je trebate smjestiti u kartu:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Place a division in the map</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Smjesti pokrajinu u kartu</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Place a division in the map</phrase>"
