"<phrase>Pogodite administrativnu podjelu pomoću njenog glavnog grada</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid "And the results are displayed when the test is finished:"
msgstr "I rezultati su prikazani kada je test završen:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Capitals of Provinces and Territories: you have a capital and four province "
