#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>match the flag with the province</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>povezite zastavu sa pokrajinom</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:289
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>match the flag with the province</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>povezite zastavu sa pokrajinom</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &kgeography;"
msgstr "Koristeći &kgeography;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:299
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kgeography; displays information about some countries and tests you about "
"those information."
msgstr ""
"&kgeography; prikazuje podatke o nekim državama i ispituje vas o tim "
"podacima."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:304
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of &kgeography;"
msgstr "Ovo je snimak ekrana od &kgeography;"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:310
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot"
msgstr "Slika ekrana"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:318
#, no-c-format
msgid "More &kgeography; features"
msgstr "Još &kgeography; mogućnosti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:320
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Another feature of &kgeography; is the possibility of zoom on a map. "
"<screenshot> <screeninfo>Zoom</screeninfo> <mediaobject> <imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"zoom.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Zoom</phrase> </textobject> </mediaobject> </screenshot> You can "
"click the <guibutton>Zoom</guibutton> button and then draw a rectangle to "
"zoom in a part of the map. While in zoom mode, you can press &RMB; to go "
"back to the original map size (the <guimenuitem>Original Size</guimenuitem> "
"action has the same effect). Use the scroll bars, the arrow keys or the "
"mouse wheel to move around the zoomed map or use the <guimenuitem>Move</"
"guimenuitem> action that will allow you to drag the map using &LMB;. The "
"<guimenuitem>Automatic Zoom</guimenuitem> feature will make the map as big "
"as possible."
msgstr ""
"Još jedna odlika kgeography; je mogućnost zumiranja na karti. <screenshot> "
"<screeninfo>Zoom</screeninfo> <mediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref="
"\"zoom.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Zoom</"
"phrase> </textobject> </mediaobject> </screenshot> Možete kliknuti "
"<guibutton>Zoom</guibutton> dugme i onda nacrtati pravougaonik da biste "
"uvećali dio karte. Dok ste u zoom režimu, možete pritisnuti &RMB; da biste "
"se vratili na originalnu veličinu karte (<guimenuitem>Originalna veličina</"
"guimenuitem> ima isti efekat). Koristite trake za pomjeranje, strelice ili "
"kotačić miša da biste se pomjerali oko uvećane karte ili koristite "
"<guimenuitem>Pomjeri</guimenuitem> akciju koja će vam omogućiti da vučete "
"kartu koristeći &LMB;. <guimenuitem>Automatski zoom</guimenuitem> "
"karakteristika će uvećati kartu koliko god je to moguće."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:346
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to make maps"
msgstr "Kako napraviti mape"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:347
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A map in &kgeography; is made by two files, one is the image of the map and "
"the other one is its description."
msgstr ""
"Karta u &kgeography; je sastavljena od dvije datoteke, prva je slika karte, "
"a druga je njen opis."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:349
#, no-c-format
msgid "Helper tool"
msgstr "Pomoćni alat"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:350
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can find <ulink url=\"https://projects.kde.org/projects/kde/kdeedu/"
"kgeography/repository/revisions/master/changes/tools/gen_map.pl\">here</"
"ulink> a tool (made by Yann Verley) which helped him with the map of France. "
"To find out its usage, simply execute it and read the help message. It "
"basically creates the <literal role=\"extension\">.kgm</literal> file from a "
"plain text file and creates a file with the colors it has assigned to each "
"division, so you can fill the map according to them."
msgstr ""
"Možete pronaći <ulink url=\"https://projects.kde.org/projects/kde/kdeedu/"
"kgeography/repository/revisions/master/changes/tools/gen_map.pl\">ovdje</"
"ulink> alat (napravljen od strane Yann Verley) koji mu je pomogao sa kartom "
"Francuske. Da biste pronašli njegovu upotrebu, jednostavno ga pokrenite i "
"pročitajte poruku za pomoć. U osnovi, on kreira <literal role=\"extension\">."
"kgm</literal> datoteku od obične tekstualne datoteke i kreira datoteku sa "
"bojama koje je dodijelio svakoj diviziji, tako da možete popuniti kartu u "
"skladu s njima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:352
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There is another tool <ulink url=\"https://projects.kde.org/projects/kde/"
"kdeedu/kgeography/repository/revisions/master/changes/tools/colorchecker.py"
"\">colorchecker.py</ulink> written by Albert Astals Cid. You need PyQt4 to "
"run this. Just run this with the .kgm filename as argument (you also need "
"the .png file of the map in the same folder). This will tell you if any "
"pixel on the map has a different color which is not defined in the .kgm "
"(description) file."
msgstr ""
"Postoji još jedan alat <ulink url=\"https://projects.kde.org/projects/kde/"
"kdeedu/kgeography/repository/revisions/master/changes/tools/colorchecker.py"
"\">colorchecker.py</ulink> koji je napisao Albert Astals Cid. Treba vam "
"PyQt4 da biste ga pokrenuli. Samo ga pokrenite sa .kgm imenom datoteke kao "
"argumentom (također vam treba .png datoteka karte u istom folderu). On će "
"vam reći ako neki piksel na karti ima drugačiju boju, koja nije definisana "
"u .kgm (opisnoj) datoteci."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:356
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please read also the tutorial <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/kgeography/"
"tutorials/kgeography-addmaps.pdf\">How to add maps</ulink> on the "
"&kgeography; website."
msgstr ""
"Molimo vas da pročitate i tutorijal <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/"
"kgeography/tutorials/kgeography-addmaps.pdf\">Kako dodati mape</ulink> na "
"&kgeography; web stranici."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:363
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description file"
msgstr "Datoteka sa opisom"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:364
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The description file is needed and its file extension is <literal role="
"\"extension\">.kgm</literal>. It should begin with <sgmltag class=\"starttag"
"\">!DOCTYPE kgeographyMap</sgmltag>, followed by <sgmltag class=\"starttag"
"\">map</sgmltag> and end with <sgmltag class=\"endtag\">map</sgmltag>."
msgstr ""
"Potrebna je opisna datoteka i njena ekstenzija je <literal role=\"extension"
"\">.kgm</literal>. Trebala bi početi sa <sgmltag class=\"starttag\">!DOCTYPE "
"kgeographyKarta</sgmltag>, praćena sa <sgmltag class=\"starttag\">karta</"
"sgmltag> i završiti sa <sgmltag class=\"endtag\">karta</sgmltag>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:367
#, no-c-format
msgid "Inside of those tags there should be:"
msgstr "Unutar tih oznaka trebalo bi biti:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:371
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">mapFile</sgmltag> and <sgmltag class=\"endtag"
"\">mapFile</sgmltag>: the name of the file (without any path) containing the "
"map image, &eg; <quote>europe.png</quote>."
msgstr ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">mapFile</sgmltag> i <sgmltag class=\"endtag"
"\">mapFile</sgmltag>: ime datoteke (bez ikakve putanje) koja sadrži sliku "
"karte, &eg; <quote>europe.png</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:374
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">name</sgmltag> and <sgmltag class=\"endtag"
"\">name</sgmltag>: the name of map, &eg; <quote>Europe</quote>."
msgstr ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">ime</sgmltag> i <sgmltag class=\"endtag\">ime</"
"sgmltag>: ime mape, &eg; <quote>Europa</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:377
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">divisionsName</sgmltag> and <sgmltag class="
"\"endtag\">divisionsName</sgmltag>: the general name of divisions in this "
"map, that is, Provinces, States, Countries, etc."
msgstr ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">imeDivizije</sgmltag> i <sgmltag class=\"endtag"
"\">imeDivizije</sgmltag>: Generalno ime divizije u ovoj karti, koje je, "
"Provincije, Države, itd."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:380
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <sgmltag class=\"starttag\">division</sgmltag> and <sgmltag class=\"endtag"
"\">division</sgmltag> for each division in the map."
msgstr ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">podjela</sgmltag> i <sgmltag class=\"endtag"
"\">podjela</sgmltag> za svaku podjelu na karti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:384
#, no-c-format
msgid "Each division has these tags:"
msgstr "Svaka podjela ima ove oznake:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:388
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">name</sgmltag> and <sgmltag class=\"endtag"
"\">name</sgmltag>: the name of the division, &eg; <quote>Albania</quote>."
msgstr ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">ime</sgmltag> i <sgmltag class=\"endtag\">ime</"
"sgmltag>: ime divizije, &eg; <quote>Albanija</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:391
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">capital</sgmltag> and <sgmltag class=\"endtag"
"\">capital</sgmltag>: the name of the capital of the division, &eg; "
"<quote>Tirana</quote>."
msgstr ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">glavni grad</sgmltag> i <sgmltag class=\"endtag"
"\">glavni grad</sgmltag>: ime glavno grada podjele, &eg; <quote>Tirana</"
"quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:394
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">ignore</sgmltag> and <sgmltag class=\"endtag"
"\">ignore</sgmltag>: can be set to <userinput>yes</userinput>, "
"<userinput>allowClickMode</userinput>, <userinput>allowClickFlagMode</"
"userinput> and <userinput>no</userinput>. If this tag is set to "
"<userinput>yes</userinput> then the division will be ignored when asking for "
"divisions in that map. It is then as if this division does not exist in "
"&kgeography; quiz modes. If this tag is set to <userinput>allowClickMode</"
"userinput> then &kgeography; will ask for the division in the "
"<guibutton>Location of ...</guibutton> mode but not in other quiz modes. If "
"this tag is set to <userinput>allowClickFlagMode</userinput> then "
"&kgeography; will ask for the division in the <guibutton>Location of ...</"
"guibutton> mode and in the flag related quizes but not in other quiz modes. "
"Setting this tag to <userinput>no</userinput> means the division will appear "
"in all modes (browse and quizzes). This tag is optional and when there is no "
"<sgmltag class=\" starttag\">ignore</sgmltag> tag that means as it is set to "
"<userinput>no</userinput>. For example <quote>Algeria</quote> has this tag "
"set to <userinput>yes</userinput> in the <quote>Europe</quote> map which "
"means that <quote>Algeria</quote> will not be part of any quiz in the "
"<quote>Europe</quote> map."
msgstr ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">ignoriši</sgmltag> i <sgmltag class=\"endtag"
"\">ignoriši</sgmltag>: može biti postavljeno na <userinput>da</userinput>, "
"<userinput>dozvoliKlikRežim</userinput>, "
"<userinput>dozvoliKlikNaZastavuRežim</userinput> i <userinput>ne</"
"userinput>. Ako je ova oznaka postavljena na <userinput>da</userinput> onda "
"će divizija biti ignorisana pri pitanju za divizije na karti. To je tada kao "
"da divizije ne postoje u &kgeography; kvizu. Ako je oznaka postavljena na "
"<userinput>dozvoliKlikRežim</userinput> onda će &kgeography; pitati za "
"diviziju u <guibutton>Lokacija ...</guibutton> režimu, ali ne i u ostalim "
"režimima kviza. Ako je ova oznaka postavljena na "
"<userinput>dozvoliKlikNaZastavuRežim</userinput> onda će &kgeography; pitati "
"za diviziju u <guibutton>Lokacija ...</guibutton> režimu i u kvizovima sa "
"zastavama, ali ne i u ostalim režimima kviza. Postavka ove oznake na "
"<userinput>ne</userinput> znači da će se divizija prikazati u svim režimima "
"(pretraživanjima i kvizovima). Ova oznaka je proizvoljna i kada nema "
"<sgmltag class=\" starttag\">ignoriši</sgmltag> oznake, to znači kao da je "
"postavljena na <userinput>ne</userinput>. Naprimjer, <quote>Alžir</quote> "
"ima svoju oznaku postavljenu na <userinput>da</userinput> u karti "
"<quote>Europa</quote> što znači da <quote>Alžir</quote> neće biti dio "
"nijednog kviza u <quote>Europa</quote> karti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:398
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">flag</sgmltag> and <sgmltag class=\"endtag"
"\">flag</sgmltag>: the file (without any path) containing the flag of the "
"division, &eg; <quote>albania.png</quote>. This tag is optional. Not needed "
"for the divisions whose <sgmltag class=\"starttag\">ignore</sgmltag> tag is "
"set to <userinput>yes</userinput>."
msgstr ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">zastava</sgmltag> i <sgmltag class=\"endtag"
"\">zastava</sgmltag>: datoteka (bez ikakvog puta), koja sadrži zastavu "
"podjele, &eg; <quote>albania.png</quote>. Ova oznaka je proizvoljna. "
"Nepotrebna za podjele čija <sgmltag class=\"starttag\">ignoriši</sgmltag> "
"oznaka je postavljena na <userinput>da</userinput>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:401
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">color</sgmltag> and <sgmltag class=\"endtag"
"\">color</sgmltag>: the color the division has in the map."
msgstr ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">boja</sgmltag> i <sgmltag class=\"endtag\">boja</"
"sgmltag>: boja koju divizija ima u karti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:404
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">falseCapital</sgmltag> and <sgmltag class="
"\"endtag\">falseCapital</sgmltag>: There can be any number of falseCapital "
"pairs, they are used to provide a list of false answers to the capital "
"question instead of choosing the false answers amongst the other divisions "
"capitals."
msgstr ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">pogrešanGlavniGrad</sgmltag> i <sgmltag class="
"\"endtag\">pogrešanGlavniGrad</sgmltag>: Može postojati bilo koji broj "
"pogrešanGlavniGrad parova, oni se koriste da pruže listu pogrešnih odgovora "
"na glavna pitanja umjesto odabiranja pogrešnih odgovora među ostalim glavnim "
"gradovima divizija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:408
#, no-c-format
msgid "The color is defined using three tags:"
msgstr "Boja je definisana sa tri oznake:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:412
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">red</sgmltag> and <sgmltag class=\"endtag\">red</"
"sgmltag>: red component of the color. Valid values are between 0 and 255."
msgstr ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">crvena</sgmltag> i <sgmltag class=\"endtag"
"\">crvena</sgmltag>: crvena komponenta boje. Validne vrijednosti su između 0 "
"i 255."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:415
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">green</sgmltag> and <sgmltag class=\"endtag"
"\">green</sgmltag>: green component of the color. Valid values are between 0 "
"and 255."
msgstr ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">zelena</sgmltag> i <sgmltag class=\"endtag"
"\">zelena</sgmltag>: zelena komponenta boje. Validne vrijednosti su između 0 "
"i 255."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:418
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">blue</sgmltag> and <sgmltag class=\"endtag"
"\">blue</sgmltag>: blue component of the color. Valid values are between 0 "
"and 255."
msgstr ""
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">plava</sgmltag> i <sgmltag class=\"endtag"
"\">plava</sgmltag>: plava komponenta boje. Validne vrijednosti su između 0 i "
"255."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:423
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is convenient to create 2 or 3 false divisions like <quote>Water</quote>, "
"<quote>Frontier</quote> and <quote>Coast</quote> and set them with the "
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">ignore</sgmltag> tag set to <userinput>yes</"
"userinput>. Don't forget <userinput>not to set</userinput> color for any "
"<quote>Frontier</quote> 0,0,0 in RGB. Please make it something like 1,1,1 so "
"that a border outline comes while placing any division on the map."
msgstr ""
"Praktično je kreirati 2 ili 3 lažne podjele kao <quote>Voda</quote>, "
"<quote>Granica</quote> i <quote>Obala</quote> i postaviti im <sgmltag class="
"\"starttag\">ignoriši</sgmltag> oznaku na <userinput>da</userinput>. Nemojte "
"zaboraviti da <userinput>ne postavljate</userinput> boju za svaku "
"<quote>Granicu</quote> 0,0,0 u RGB. Molimo napravite nešto kao 1,1,1 tako da "
"se obris granica prikazuje dok se stavlja bilo koja podjela na kartu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:428
#, no-c-format
msgid "All names (capitals and divisions) must be in English."
msgstr "Sva imena (glavnih gradova i podjela) moraju biti na engleskom."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:432
#, no-c-format
msgid "Map file"
msgstr "Datoteka sa mapama"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:433
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The map file is quite simple but laborious to create. It has to be in "
"<acronym>PNG</acronym> format. You can find some maps to transform at <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.cia.gov/library/publications/the-world-factbook/docs/"
"refmaps.html\">Cia Reference Maps</ulink>. If no map fits your needs you can "
"download the <ulink url=\"https://www.cia.gov/library/publications/the-world-"
"factbook/reference_maps/pdf/political_world.pdf\">political world map</"
"ulink>, take a screenshot of it and work from it. Each division in the map "
"should have one and only one color. To achieve this you can use image "
"processing programs like <application>The Gimp</application> and "
"<application>Kolourpaint</application>."
msgstr ""
"Datoteka sa kartom je prilično jednostavna, ali mukotrpna za napraviti. Mora "
"biti u <acronym>PNG</acronym> formatu. Možete pronaći neke karte za "
"transformaciju na <ulink url=\"https://www.cia.gov/library/publications/the-"
"world-factbook/docs/refmaps.html\">Cia referentne karte</ulink>. Ako nema "
"karte koja odgovara vašim potrebama, možete skinuti <ulink url=\"https://www."
"cia.gov/library/publications/the-world-factbook/reference_maps/pdf/"
"political_world.pdf\">politička karta svijeta</ulink>, napraviti snimku "
"zaslona i raditi odatle. Svaka podjela na karti bi trebala imati samo jednu "
"boju. Da biste to postigli, možete koristit programe za obradu slika poput "
"<application>The Gimp</application> i <application>Kolourpaint</application>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:440
#, no-c-format
msgid "Flags"
msgstr "Zastave"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:441
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have used the <sgmltag class=\"starttag\">flag</sgmltag> tag you "
"should provide the flag files. They have to be in <acronym>PNG</acronym> "
"format and better if they are 300x200 pixels and you provide a <acronym>SVG</"
"acronym> file for it. To obtain <acronym>SVG</acronym> flags of almost all "
"countries in the world and some other divisions, you can consult the <ulink "
"url=\"http://sourceforge.net/project/showfiles.php?group_id=4054&amp;"
"package_id=16668&amp;release_id=208770\">Sodipodi flags collection</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste koristili <sgmltag class=\"starttag\">zastava</sgmltag> oznaku, "
"trebate obezbijediti datoteke za zastave. One moraju biti u <acronym>PNG</"
"acronym> formatu i bolje bi bilo da su 300x200 piksela i da obezbijedite "
"<acronym>SVG</acronym> datoteku za njih. Da dobijete <acronym>SVG</acronym> "
"zastave skoro svih država na svijetu i nekih drugih podjela, možete "
"konsultovati <ulink url=\"http://sourceforge.net/project/showfiles.php?"
"group_id=4054&amp;package_id=16668&amp;release_id=208770\">Sodipodi "
"kolekcija zastava</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:446
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to test"
msgstr "Kako testirati"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:447
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Before sending your map to Albert &Albert.Astals.Cid.mail;, you should test "
"it to see it has no errors. To achieve that, you have to do the following: "
"<itemizedlist> <listitem> <para>Put the map description and map image file "
"in <filename class=\"directory\">$<envar>KDEDIR</envar>/share/apps/"
"kgeography/</filename></para> </listitem> <listitem> <para>Put the flag "
"<acronym>PNG</acronym> files (if any) in <filename class=\"directory\">"
"$<envar>KDEDIR</envar>/share/apps/kgeography/flags/</filename></para> </"
"listitem> </itemizedlist> Once that has been done you should be able of "
"opening your map from inside &kgeography;."
msgstr ""
"Prije nego što pošaljete svoju kartu na Albert &Albert.Astals.Cid.mail;, "
"trebate je testirati da vidite da nema grešaka. Da biste to postigli, morate "
"uraditi slijedeće: <itemizedlist> <listitem> <para>Stavite datoteke sa "
"opisom i slikom karte u <filename class=\"directory\">$<envar>KDEDIR</envar>/"
"share/apps/kgeography/</filename></para> </listitem> <listitem> "
"<para>Stavite zastavu <acronym>PNG</acronym> datoteke (ako ih ima) u "
"<filename class=\"directory\">$<envar>KDEDIR</envar>/share/apps/kgeography/"
"flags/</filename></para> </listitem> </itemizedlist> Jednom kada ste to "
"uradili, trebali biste moći otvarati svoju kartu iz &kgeography;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:459
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you don't know which is your <filename class=\"directory\">"
"$<envar>KDEDIR</envar></filename>, type <userinput><command>kde4-config</"
"command> <option>--prefix</option></userinput> in a shell."
msgstr ""
"Ako ne znate koji je vaš <filename class=\"directory\">$<envar>KDEDIR</"
"envar></filename>, ukucajte <userinput><command>kde4-config</command> "
"<option>--prefix</option></userinput> u školjku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:463
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the colorchecker.py tool from the helper tools to check if any extra "
"color left on the map which is not defined on the .kgm file."
msgstr ""
"Koristite colorchecker.py alat iz pomoćnih alata da provjerite da li je "
"ostala neka boja na karti koja nije definisana .kgm datotekom."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:469
#, no-c-format
msgid "Non political maps"
msgstr "Nepolitičke karte"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:470
#, no-c-format
msgid "Is it possible to do non-political maps? Yes, it is!"
msgstr "Da li je moguće raditi sa nepolitičkim kartama? Da, jeste!"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:472
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Example of how to create a non political map</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Primjer kako kreirati nepolitičku kartu</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:478
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Example of how to create a non political map</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Primjer kako kreirati nepolitičku kartu</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:483
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Of course, the division concept can be extended to a river or a mountain. "
"During the creation of the map, you should keep in mind that most times the "
"river or mountain will be too small that you should provide an additional "
"clicking area. In this example the river would have the maroon area and "
"color &lt;20,76,34&gt; as its identifier."
msgstr ""
"Naravno, koncept podjela može biti proširen i na rijeku ili planinu. U toku "
"kreiranja karte, trebate imat na umu da će u većini slučajeva rijeka ili "
"planina biti premala tako da biste trebali pružiti dodatno područje za klik. "
"U ovom primjeru, rijeka će imati bordo područje i boju &lt;20,76,34&gt; kao "
"svoj identifikator."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:491
#, no-c-format
msgid "Command Reference"
msgstr "Komandna referenca"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:500
#, no-c-format
msgid "The main &kgeography; window"
msgstr "Glavni &kgeography; prozor"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:503
#, no-c-format
msgid "The File Menu"
msgstr "Izbornik datoteka"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:507
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Open Map...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Fajl</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Otvori mapu...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:514
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Open the choose map dialog. If you type quickly enough the first letters of "
"the map you look for will select the first map that matches."
msgstr ""
"Otvorite dijalog za biranje karte. Ako dovoljno brzo otkucate prva slova "
"karte koji tražite, označit će se prva karta koja se podudara."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:518
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Izlaz</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:525
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Quits</action> &kgeography;"
msgstr "<action>Izlazi</action> &kgeography;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:533
#, no-c-format
msgid "The View Menu"
msgstr "Izbornik pregled"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:537
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Zoom</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Pregled</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Zoom</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:541
#, no-c-format
msgid "Goes in zoom mode, then draw a rectangle to zoom in a part of the map"
msgstr ""
"Ide u uvećani režim, onda nacrta pravougaonik da bi se uvećao dio karte"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:544
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Original Size</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Pregled</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Izvorna veličina</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:548
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Sets</action> the map back to its original size as defined in the "
"map file. A &RMB; click in zoomed mode performs the same action"
msgstr ""
"<action>Postavlja</action> kartu natrag na originalnu veličinu definiranu u "
"datoteci karte. &RMB; klik u zoom režimu vrši istu akciju"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:552
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Automatic Zoom</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Pregled</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Automatski zoom</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:556
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Sets</action> the map to automatic zoom using as much space as "
"possible when resizing the &kgeography; window"
msgstr ""
"<action>Postavlja</action> kartu na automatski zoom režim koristeći koliko "
"je moguće prostora pri promjeni veličine &kgeography; prozora"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:559
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Move</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Pregled</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Pomjeri</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:563
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Moves</action> the current map. This item is only enabled, if you "
"have zoomed into the map."
msgstr ""
"<action>Pomjera</action> trenutnu kartu. Ova stavka je jedino omogućena, ako "
"ste uvećali kartu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:571
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Settings Menu"
msgstr "Izbornik postavki"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:572
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kgeography; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu items, "
"for more information read the section about the <ulink url=\"help:/"
"fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Settings Menu</ulink> of the &kde; "
"Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"&kgeography; ima slične &kde; <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> stavke izbornika, "
"za više informacija pročitajte poglavlje o <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/"
"ui.html#menus-settings\">Izbornik postavki</ulink> &kde; Osnove."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:579
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Help Menu"
msgstr "Pomoćni izbornik"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:581
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kgeography; has a default &kde; <guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu as described "
"in the <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\">&kde; "
"Fundamentals</ulink> with two additional entries:"
msgstr ""
"&kgeography; ima zadani &kde; <guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu> izbornik opisan u "
"<ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\">&kde; Osnove</ulink> sa "
"dva dodatna ulaza:"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:587
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Help</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Disclaimer</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Izjava o odricanju odgovornosti</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:591
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Displays</action> a disclaimer about the accuracy of maps, flags and "
"translations used by &kgeography;."
msgstr ""
"<action>Prikazuje</action> izjavu o odricanju odgovornosti za preciznost "
"karti, zastava i prevoda korištenih od strane &kgeography;."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:596
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Help</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Map author</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Autor mape</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:600
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Displays</action> the name of author who created the current map."
msgstr "<action>Prikazuje</action> ime autora koji je napravio trenutnu mapu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:612
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:616
#, no-c-format
msgid "Question Alignment"
msgstr "Poravnanje pitanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:617
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Determines the position of the questions in the window, default is "
"<guilabel>Top-left</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Određuje položaj pitanja u prozoru, zadano je <guilabel>Vrh-lijevo</"
"guilabel>."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:620
#, no-c-format
msgid "Wait for Validation"
msgstr "Pricekajte za provjeru valjanosti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:621
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If enabled the user will have to press <guibutton>Accept</guibutton> after "
"choosing an answer."
msgstr ""
"Ako je omogućeno, korisnik će morati pritisnuti  <guibutton>Prihvati</"
"guibutton> nakon odabiranja odgovora."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:624
#, no-c-format
msgid "Focus follows Mouse"
msgstr "Fokus slijedi miša"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:625
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If enabled pressing Space will trigger the button under the mouse pointer."
msgstr ""
"Ako je omogućenom, pritiskom na razmak, aktivirat će se dugme ispod "
"pokazivača miša."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:628
#, no-c-format
msgid "Map divisions colors"
msgstr "Boje podjele mape"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:629
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can choose if you always want to keep the same colors (default) or if "
"you want to use random colors: with this option random colors are assigned "
"to the divisions in the map. This helps the user to focus and learn the "
"division shapes and not the division colors."
msgstr ""
"Možete izabrati da li želite uvijek čuvati iste boje (zadano) ili želite "
"koristiti razne boje: sa ovom opcijom, razne boje su dodijeljene divizijama "
"na karti. Ovo pomaže korisniku da se fokusira i nauči oblike, a ne boje "
"divizija."

